2crDOz51mGaRi7n7CkXXEbCzl5VR3f27ac9y363BlOu_woF1VJ3alSsLhLiZ4ryekQZS4NYQA8n3HWj-S3qr9Dn1730qYGL4BX4sh5InFDxIQLrbefAy6zAs0BdvqsJ6jKFZIQHuo1Q3l4Ov4-2yZ_6bKSgasowJaa0tNrWBThZU1B5VZ9obiVg9fQVHpPDySNIRgAKeDGAYoKtKR7Ij-Ii2u-gRFum8jrc5mjHPyCKapHN_A4B2lSOTloQSYn6JxyoUrKJRlmi_6ZC09R4DP47R8kJAddRRsM1dhxE_pYS1yjtm5mGXjK42HS2kBivMMEd-g_tSUGDcM7PLBitAij7um8Z-iaLuUnGt35k-WdOQWUTKm8x-jqsFPGrt0Gg-SsRZdfwrDeFE40dOxa2zN3oItP_8XUvI7k3IXXSQEf8VyXWnT51Pm8Gic6OW9bddDMd836ONWY5VeUFdOZjJRShZE4n2FAktpX1dR0UW6G5O2ixD1z5D9CY_N1kGKPVVpyp6j8Nnr91Pza3sPH6BLlxi32o-LNjAwLW_WXBKIMNqXoGKwsScY27VdtlX8w8XvlXFL7QjCDzZMx1rBDr_rnpn4-vEqjtAwgpLkL5QV8OWaW-EK6NHJ2VhoAGO38SSaMQ1q3B1bsgATIuD_oeHXY5L-sLd4jyK751xmihaMIOPl5q6BosS3tubWPcNECrr_5umIa0B0Pq4SBeOGt-vkRJ9XgmGLw88NtvXnax0rKETdXmne3-OMxNsY763j5zc2zLi-OkVkACH9g=="},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_04de6b92baab60ea016adb45d97b208191a89638fb6c95fcab","call_id":"call_34d5fc47ffaf47968a330919c9988d48","name":"check_artifact","arguments":"{\"artifact_json\":\"{\\\"base_candidate\\\":27,\\\"patches\\\":[{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/locals\\\",\\\"value\\\":[{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"r\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"positive real\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R004\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"arbitrary\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Fix arbitrary r>0.\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"j\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"Fin n spatial coordinate index\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R004\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"arbitrary\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Fix an arbitrary spatial coordinate index j∈Fin n for the integration-by-parts calculation; the resulting identity is then summed over all j.\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"n\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"v_j\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"the jth standard basis vector of ℝⁿ\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R004\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"definition\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Let v_j be the jth standard basis vector in ℝⁿ.\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"j\\\",\\\"n\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"f_j\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"ℝⁿ→ℝᵐ\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R004\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"definition\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Define f_j(x)=∂_{x_j}u(x,r).\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"u\\\",\\\"j\\\",\\\"r\\\"]},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"g\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"ℝⁿ→ℝᵐ\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"R004\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"end\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"definition\\\",\\\"declaration\\\":\\\"Define g(x)=u_t(x,r).\\\",\\\"from_inputs\\\":[],\\\"from_local\\\":[],\\\"objects\\\":[\\\"u\\\",\\\"r\\\"]}]},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/0/text\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Fix arbitrary r>0 and spatial index j∈Fin n; define v_j=e_j, f_j(x)=∂_{x_j}u(x,r), and g(x)=u_t(x,r). N001 directly supplies a closed time window containing r and a compact C outside which u=q throughout that window. Because u is jointly smooth and is constant on the open set (ℝⁿ\\\\\\\\C)×J, f_j,g and their Frechet derivatives vanish outside C and are continuous. Thus the three functions ⟨Df_j(x)[v_j],g(x)⟩, ⟨f_j(x),Dg(x)[v_j]⟩, and ⟨f_j(x),g(x)⟩ are continuous and supported in C. By M001, once the ambient finite-on-compacts property proved in R002 is instantiated, all three are integrable. Smoothness gives the Frechet derivative identities everywhere, in particular on tsupport(g) for f_j and tsupport(f_j) for g. Apply M011 with X=ℝⁿ, F=G=ℝᵐ, W=ℝ, B the Euclidean dot product and direction v_j. It gives ∫⟨∂_{x_j}u,∂_{x_j}u_t⟩=−∫⟨∂_{x_jx_j}u,u_t⟩. Since j was arbitrary, sum these identities over j=1,…,n. The finite-dimensional product rule yields ∫e_t=2∫u_t·(u_{tt}−Δ_xu). N002 identifies E′(r)=∫e_t, proving N003 for arbitrary r>0.\\\"}]}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function